  "title": "Suffix IT Limited : Software Company in Bangladesh",
  "text": "Home\nAbout\nProducts\nIoT\nServices\nCareer\nContact\nCustom Applications\nHomeCustom Applications\nCustom Application\n\nWork smarter with custom-made applications for more efficient services. We collaborate with clients to determine their unique requirements during a discovery process, build a realistic employment opportunity, and promptly deliver well-crafted online systems that boost businesses and delight customers through their simple, clean interfaces.\nWe provide custom software application development and maintenance services for all types of businesses.\n\nKey Features\nSoftware Application Consulting\nSoftware Application Consulting\n\nInvestigate and uncover complex business needs in order to better understand their needs and provide software consulting services. From project ideation to initialization to designing, development, and post-development advising, our tech mavens fend off important business obstacles that arise at various stages of software lifecycle development.\n\nMigration of Applications\nMigration of Applications\n\nTo fulfill the unique requirements of clients and their application development deadlines, accelerate time to market with easy application conversion services. Our application migration services ensure that applications are deployed or redeployed on newer or more advanced platforms, allowing businesses to be more flexible and sustainable.\n\nProduct development for software\nProduct development for software\n\nExplore, analyze, and implement the client's software development requirements to create resilient software products that can withstand changing market trends. For enterprises with a strategic development strategy, robust backend services, and interactive frontend services that promise maximum revenue, we offer ground-breaking services.\n\nApplication Maintenance\nApplication Maintenance\n\nWe focus on improving application performance by streamlining its operations and maintaining it to remain high-performing and efficient, using cutting-edge technologies. Our development teams provide hassle-free application maintenance, streamlined migration, painless reengineering, and seamless redesigning services to meet every business demand.\n\nProviding the Best Solution for\nSchedule a Live Demo\nGo for a free practical demonstration in order to experience the user friendly platform of Suffix Field Force Management.\nREQUEST FOR A DEMO\n\nWe maintain strategic partnerships with multiple organizations in Bangladesh and worldwide, working together to deliver high-quality solutions and long-term value.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nCha-70,70/A, Rupayan Millennium Square (9A), Progoti Sharoni, North Badda, Gulshan, Dhaka-1212.\n\ninfo@suffixit.com\n\n+88 01958 424000\n\nQUICK LINKS\nAbout Us\nCareer\nContact Us\n\n© 2026 All Rights Reserved by Suffix IT Limited",
